<title>JAPAN: Asahi Glass - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Asahi Glass - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		434.23		vs	  454.29</p>
<p> Operating	    4.68		vs	    4.58</p>
<p> Current	     14.38		vs	   14.34</p>
<p> Net		    9.49		vs	    8.23</p>
<p> EPS		    8.08 yen	  vs	    7.00 yen</p>
